  "description": "After the implementation of the female conscription system, newly commissioned Staff Sergeant Kim Hyunjoo is assigned as the only male instructor at a women-only recruit training corps due to a clerical mistake by the military personnel department. There, he comes face-to-face with two trainees: the school bully who tormented him during his student days, and his first love… \n\n(Source: TOPTOON, translated)",
